OL,3,GNEWSACobbles work kicks off town centre
OL,4,Arevamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #2.6m year-long scheme to enhance a
OL,7,Fmarket town's historic gateway is due
OL,8,Fto get under way.
OL,10,FThe refurbishment of Alnwick's Cobbles
OL,11,Farea will be the first of three
OL,12,Fprojects which aim to celebrate the
OL,13,Ftown's heritage and improve public
OL,14,Fspaces, Northumberland County Council
OL,15,Fhas said.
OL,17,FIt includes a new green space, road
OL,18,Fresurfacing, new paving, crossing
OL,19,Fimprovements, landscaping and street
OL,20,Ffurniture.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
